#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. <xref linkend="sysprof"/>
#.  (for profiling),
#.  It seems that XMLRPC is part of PHP 5.4.10
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"apache\"/> (required to run the test suite), <xref "
"linkend=\"brotli\"/>, <xref linkend=\"curl\"/> (required to run the test "
"suite), <xref linkend=\"mitkrb\"/> (required to run the test suite), <xref "
"linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/>, <xref linkend=\"php\"/> compiled with XMLRPC-EPI "
"support (only used for the XMLRPC regression tests), <xref "
"linkend=\"samba\"/> (ntlm_auth is required to run the test suite), and "
"<ulink url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"apache\"/> (exigido para executar a suíte de teste), <xref "
"linkend=\"brotli\"/>, <xref linkend=\"curl\"/> (exigido para executar a "
"suíte de teste), <xref linkend=\"mitkrb\"/> (exigido para executar a suíte "
"de teste), <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/>, <xref linkend=\"php\"/> compilado "
"com suporte XMLRPC-EPI (usado somente para os testes de regressão XMLRPC), "
"<xref linkend=\"samba\"/> (ntlm_auth é exigido para executar a suíte de "
"teste) e <ulink url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libsoup"
msgstr "Instalação do libsoup"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libsoup</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>libsoup</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:144
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D vapi=enabled     \\\n"
"            -D gssapi=disabled  \\\n"
"            -D sysprof=disabled \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D vapi=enabled     \\\n"
"            -D gssapi=disabled  \\\n"
"            -D sysprof=disabled \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#.  Upstream issue #120.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>.  One test named "
"<filename>ssl-test</filename> is known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: &quot;<command>ninja test</command>&quot;."
" Um teste chamado &quot;<filename>ssl-test</filename>&quot; é conhecido por "
"falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:165
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D vapi=disabled</option>: Use this if you have not installed "
"<application>Vala</application>, e.g. because you are not building "
"<application>GNOME</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D vapi=disabled</option>: Use isso se não tiver instalado o "
"<application>Vala</application>, por exemplo, porque você não está "
"construindo o <application>GNOME</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D doc=enabled</option>: Use this option if you want to build the "
"documentation. Note that you must have <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D doc=enabled</option>: Use essa opção se quiser construir a "
"documentação. Observe que você precisa ter o <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> "
"instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D gssapi=disabled</parameter>: libsoup defaults to building with"
" GSSAPI support, which requires Kerberos (as does the test suite). If you "
"are building GNOME or have kerberos installed, remove this option."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D gssapi=disabled</parameter>: libsoup padroniza para construir "
"com suporte GSSAPI, que exige Kerberos (assim como a suíte de teste). Se "
"você estiver construindo o GNOME ou tiver o kerberos instalado, remova essa "
"opção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/libsoup.xml:193
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D sysprof=disabled</parameter>: libsoup will automatically "
"download a git version of <ulink url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink> if "
"git is available or use the installed version if it is present on the "
"system.  If you need profiling, remove this option."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D sysprof=disabled</parameter>: libsoup baixará automaticamente "
"uma versão git de <ulink url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink> se o git "
"estiver disponível ou usará a versão instalada se estiver presente no "
"sistema. Se você precisar de perfilamento, remova essa opção."

